          "statement": "Rhiza runs are fully managed from five small single-purpose Rex apps built on rexuikit (Inbox, Request, Runs, Daemon and Autonomy), each a small modal that opens over the current pane, does one job and closes; every other app is gone and the CLI keeps every command."
